    {
      "order": 1,
      "file": "hsk2_sc049_line_001.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "最近周末你比以前忙多了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 2,
      "file": "hsk2_sc049_line_002.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "是，不过这种忙不一样。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 3,
      "file": "hsk2_sc049_line_003.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "认识新朋友的忙？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 4,
      "file": "hsk2_sc049_line_004.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "差不多。现在有人会问我周末有没有空。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 5,
      "file": "hsk2_sc049_line_005.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "听起来你的生活圈真的变大了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 6,
      "file": "hsk2_sc049_line_006.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "最开始我只认识你和工作上的几个人。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 7,
      "file": "hsk2_sc049_line_007.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "现在呢？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 8,
      "file": "hsk2_sc049_line_008.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "有王明、陈宇、刘梅，还有活动里认识的几个人。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 9,
      "file": "hsk2_sc049_line_009.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "而且他们是不同地方认识的。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 10,
      "file": "hsk2_sc049_line_010.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，所以聊天的话题也不一样。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 11,
      "file": "hsk2_sc049_line_011.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "这对中文也很有帮助。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 12,
      "file": "hsk2_sc049_line_012.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "我现在听不同人的说法更习惯了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 13,
      "file": "hsk2_sc049_line_013.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "你自己主动说话也多了。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 14,
      "file": "hsk2_sc049_line_014.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "以前总等别人先问我。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 15,
      "file": "hsk2_sc049_line_015.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "现在会主动邀请别人吗？",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 16,
      "file": "hsk2_sc049_line_016.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "还在练，不过已经没有以前那么难。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 17,
      "file": "hsk2_sc049_line_017.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_LI_NA_001",
      "textZh": "这就是很大的变化。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 18,
      "file": "hsk2_sc049_line_018.m4a",
      "type": "dialogue",
      "voiceId": "VOICE_ZHANG_WEI_001",
      "textZh": "对，我觉得杭州越来越像真正的生活，而不是一个新地方。",
      "emotion": "natural"
    },
    {
      "order": 19,
      "file": "hsk2_sc049_word_001.m4a",
